# A bookmarked task counts only the open tasks below it, and a done bookmark shows no count.
file <<END
Plan:
	- Big task @bookmark
		- Step one
		- Step two @done
		Some note
	- Old task @bookmark @done
		- Leftover
END
keys <C-g>
see Bookmarks
see Big task                                  1 │
see Old task                                    │
see Plan                                      2 │
quit
